<h1>Michelle Harris</h1>
<p>8th Ward alderman, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Filed nominating petitions for reelection on Oct. 19, 2026. No campaign website or platform for a new term found yet.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>8th Ward alderwoman since 2006 (appointed by Mayor Richard M. Daley, then elected in 2007); former chief of staff to Ald. Lorraine Dixon and former 8th Ward Streets and Sanitation superintendent.</p>
